  "assumptions": {
    "transportation": "Finite class sets, nonnegative demands and real-class capacities; arbitrary real assignment coefficients. Virtual denied-service class 0 is uncapacitated and its dual multiplier is zero.",
    "survival": "Independent natural-valued PMF laws, convolution semigroup and finite means on a nonnegative parameter set containing zero and closed under addition and nonnegative differences.",
    "revenue": "Exact integral definition G; q_i <= r_i retained; no extra integrability premise.",
    "conclusions": "Coordinate diminishing increments on the parameter semigroup and full lattice submodularity; not a claim about a different interpolation of discrete parameters."
  },
